  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Something eases. Perfection steps back a pace; the human steps forward a half. I open my fist and exhale slowly.",
    "ja": "小さくほぐれる。完璧は一歩退き、人間が半歩進む。私は拳を開いて、ゆっくり息を吐く。"
  },
